<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Truth: Life and Crimes of an Expert Imperialist and his Red Right Hand</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;The planet's wild magic has been released, giant magical plants and animals have overrun any infrastructure that might have been left after Hordak and Horde Prime, the entire global population has suffered decades of civil violence, an entire universe teeming with unknown entities is waiting just outside their orbit, and in every community in the world there are newly defected clone soldiers who are devastated, disoriented, and potentially violent. Etheria's heroes have been fighting so hard, for so long, but they still can't call the job done. Not yet, anyway. Not while there's so many open wounds left from a lifetime of total war.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>AintGonnaHauntItself</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
